        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Rescheduling as provided in Paragraph 2(e) shall be subject to the Employee's having furnished within a reasonable time a physician's certificate acceptable to the Company showing evidence of such disability. Vacation rescheduled as provided therein shall be taken after the Employee has been approved to return to full-time duty by a Company physician, except that in special circumstances and upon request of the Employee, the Company may permit the Employee to take such rescheduled vacation after recovery from the illness or injury but before returning to full-time duty.",
